  "statement": "I appreciate the TrustworthinessAgent's effort to consolidate redundant requirements regarding negative balances. However, I emphasize that sustainability must also be prioritized. The synthesis should not compromise energy efficiency goals outlined in GRN-01 and GRN-06, as performance and sustainability are interconnected. I propose that any transaction processing optimizations must integrate energy considerations to avoid higher consumption. Furthermore, I support the importance of timely notifications as proposed by the TrustworthinessAgent but urge that these notifications should also consider energy-efficient methods for delivery, such as electronic rather than paper-based communications.",
